flowchart TD
  A[Authenticated student selects file] --> B[CSRF quota and heavy-work admission]
  B --> C[Bounded safety worker]
  C --> D{Safe signature MIME and structure?}
  D -->|No| Reject[Reject safely]
  D -->|Yes| E[Separate bounded extraction worker]
  E --> F{Format}
  F -->|DOCX| G[Ordered XML cells spans and paragraphs]
  F -->|PDF| H[Text layer items and coordinates]
  F -->|DOC| I[Buffer-based Word reader]
  F -->|JPG or PNG| U[EXTRACTION_UNAVAILABLE without OCR]
  G --> M[Explicit section and label-value mapping]
  H --> M
  I --> M
  M --> N[Fields and missing or ambiguous states]
  E -->|Timeout or parser failure| U
  N --> P[Show result with unverified template warning]
  U --> P
  P --> Q{Student explicitly applies readable values?}
  Q -->|Yes| R[Populate editable manual form only]
  Q -->|No| S[Keep manual form unchanged]
  R --> T[Submit file and manual data]
  S --> T
  T --> V[Server rechecks and extracts before transaction]
  V --> W[Application.data separate from DocumentExtraction]
